cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GUARDIAN in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "GUARDIAN: Multi-Layer Identity-Based Zero-Day Defense Framework for Consumer IoT Networks"
abstract: "An edge-native, zero-trust IoT defense framework engineered for consumer gateway hardware ($250 hardware budget). GUARDIAN continuously tracks 60 transport and network metadata features across three identity layers without decrypting packet payloads, using unsupervised Isolation Forest and non-parametric robust statistics with a 4-tier graduated firewall response and explainable AI root-cause diagnostics."
